        <h3>Handling Webhook Retries with Idempotency Keys</h3>
        <p>Prevent double-processing when webhooks are retried due to failures.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/top-5-free-webhook-testing-tools" class="tutorial-card card">
        <span class="tutorial-tag">Comparison</span>
        <h3>Top 5 Free Webhook Testing Tools (2026)</h3>
        <p>Compare WebhookCatch, Webhook.site, RequestBin, Ngrok, and Postman.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/webhook-vs-api" class="tutorial-card card">
        <span class="tutorial-tag">Concepts</span>
        <h3>Webhook vs API: What's the Difference?</h3>
